### Access Assignment (Free Tier Limitation)

Due to Microsoft Entra ID Free tier limitations, application access
and app roles were assigned directly to users for demonstration purposes.

### Current State (Free Tier)
- Users assigned directly to the application
- App roles (Reader, Admin) assigned at the user level

This approach is functional but does not scale well in larger environments.

### Intended State (With Entra ID P1)
With Entra ID P1 licensing, access would be managed using group-based
assignments:

- GRP-Standard-Users → Reader role
- GRP-App-Admins → Admin role

Group-based access would:
- Improve scalability
- Simplify onboarding/offboarding
- Support access reviews and audits
- Reduce risk of orphaned permissions
